@startuml plano-control-datos
title LinkGuard: Planos de Control y Datos

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Plano de Control" as PC #E3F2FD {
    node "Orchestrator\n:8000/RPC2" as Orch
    node "Peer A\n(wg-auto-register)" as PA
    node "Peer B\n(wg-auto-register)" as PB
    node "Peer C\n(wg-auto-register)" as PC2
}

rectangle "Plano de Datos" as PD #E8F5E9 {
    cloud "wg-HUB\n(Hub Agent :51820)" as HUB
    node "wg0\n(Peer A)" as WGA
    node "wg0\n(Peer B)" as WGB
    node "wg0\n(Peer C)" as WGC
}

PA -down-> Orch : HTTP/XML-RPC\nregister/heartbeat\n(25s)
PB -down-> Orch : HTTP/XML-RPC
PC2 -down-> Orch : HTTP/XML-RPC

WGA -right-> HUB : WireGuard cifrado
WGB -left-> HUB : WireGuard cifrado
WGC -up-> HUB : WireGuard cifrado

note top of PC
  **Plano de Control** (siempre activo)
  - peer.register / peer.heartbeat
  - auth.login / auth.refresh
  - config.get_peer_config
  - peer.report_reachability
  - Protocolo: XML-RPC sobre HTTP
  - Frecuencia: cada 25s (heartbeat)
end note

note bottom of PD
  **Plano de Datos** (según topología)
  - Tráfico WireGuard cifrado
  - Topología determina routing
  - Puede ser directo o via HUB
end note

@enduml
